title: Denial Intelligence › Ways in
route: /denials
intro: Every way a person lands on Denial Intelligence. The sidebar and Analytics land on the dashboard of open denials (/denials); every link that names a denial lands on that denial's own page (/denials/D-xxxx). An older link with ?id= goes to the page too. Only denials at the sites in view count. How the sidebar badge counts open denials.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Denial Intelligence' in the sidebar"
start s5 "Analytics: a reason's 'Open in Denial Intelligence'\nor a row of 'Common denial reasons by payer'"
start s2 "Demo menu, Suggested path\n'Denial Intelligence: D-3318'"
start s3 "Click a notification\n'Denied today', 'Denied', 'Partly approved' or 'Denial analyzed'"
start s4 "Ask FLO 'Which denial is due first?'\nClick 'Open Denial Intelligence'"
start s6 "Dashboard: Do next 'Open denial', or the request drawer's 'Open in Denial Intelligence'"
start s7 "Authorizations case page (also reached from the Authorizations worklist)\nClick 'Open in Denial Intelligence'"
start s9 "Analytics case panel\nClick 'Open the denial'"

process p0 "Address /denials, maybe with ?payer= and ?reason="
screen sc1 "Dashboard of open denials\nTitle row 'Denial Intelligence' and 'Add a denial letter'\nSix figures, payer chips, one table"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list"
goto g5 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list › Filter by payer and reason"

process p1 "Address /denials/D-xxxx"
process pl "An older link /denials?id=D-xxxx (seeded notifications, the Dashboard demo control) is replaced by /denials/D-xxxx"
decision dsite "Does that denial belong to a site the viewer is looking at?"
screen sos "Out-of-site card\n'This denial is not available at Site A'\nNames the site, no patient or detail"
goto gs "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Sites › What each site sees and out-of-site links"
decision d2 "Is it an open denial, or one settled on this screen?"
screen nf "'We could not find denial D-xxxx'\nLink 'Back to Denial Intelligence'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened"

start s8 "Look at the badge beside 'Denial Intelligence' in the sidebar"
process b1 "Badge = requests in the Dashboard's 'Appeal or call' stage at the sites in view\n8 for Both sites at the start (Site A 4, Site B 4), the same as the 'Open' figure"
process b2 "Goes up by one: a letter is analyzed, or the Dashboard demo control 'Denies' or 'Approves part' is used"
process b3 "Goes down by one: the denial is accepted, a call outcome 'Overturned' or 'Partly restored' is logged, or the payer's decision on an appeal is 'Overturned' or 'Partly overturned'"

s1 --> p0
s5 --> p0
p0 --> sc1 --> g1
p0 -.->|with a payer or reason| g5
s2 --> p1
s3 --> pl --> p1
s3 --> p1
s4 --> p1
s6 --> p1
s7 --> p1
s9 --> p1
p1 --> dsite
dsite -->|No| sos --> gs
dsite -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|Yes| g2
d2 -->|No| nf --> sc1

s8 --> b1 --> b2 & b3
